flowchart TD
    Input[Node bytes] --> Detect[Smart detection]
    Detect --> Applicable[Applicable decoders]
    Applicable --> Decode[Bounded decode]
    Decode --> Hash[SHA-256 deduplication]
    Hash --> Score[Candidate scoring]
    Score --> Prune{Policy prune?}
    Prune -- no --> Child[Child node + provenance]
    Child --> Recurse[Recursive analysis]
    Prune -- yes --> Trace[Decision trace]
